<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zizhitongjian" book-id="b-zizhitongjian-103" chapter-id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession" source-id="s-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession">
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:father" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">初，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:father:m0002" ref="djo_u3b_i9w_A">殷浩</persName>卒，大司馬<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:father:m0009" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>使人□書吊之。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:father:m0017" ref="djo_u3b_i9w_A">浩</persName>子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:father:m0019" ref="djo_u3b_i9w_AA">涓</persName>不答，亦不詣<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:father:m0026" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>，而與<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:father:m0030" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAD">武陵王晞</persName>游。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:draft" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">遺詔：「大司馬<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:draft:m0007" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>依<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:draft:m0009" ref="y4i_pjk_4gn_AD">周公</persName>居攝故事。」又曰：「少子可輔者輔之，如不可，君自取之。」侍中<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:draft:m0041" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">王坦之</persName>自持詔入，於<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:draft:m0050" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAF">帝</persName>前毀之。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:altered" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:altered:m0000" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAF">帝</persName>乃使<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:altered:m0003" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">坦之</persName>改詔曰：「家國事一稟<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:altered:m0015" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">大司馬</persName>，如<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:altered:m0020" ref="11e_f2d_5d2">諸葛武侯</persName>、<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:altered:m0025" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">王丞相</persName>故事。」是日，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:altered:m0035" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAF">帝</persName>崩。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:regency" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:regency:m0000" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAB">崇德太后</persName>令，以<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:regency:m0007" ref="uke_dff_yrf">帝</persName>沖幼，加在諒闇，令<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:regency:m0017" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>依<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:regency:m0019" ref="y4i_pjk_4gn_AD">周公</persName>居攝故事。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:regency-returned" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:regency-returned:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">王彪之</persName>曰：「此異常大事，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:regency-returned:m0012" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">大司馬</persName>必當固讓，使萬機停滯，稽廢山陵，未敢奉令，謹具封還。」事遂不行。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:pair" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:pair:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>弟江州刺史<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:pair:m0006" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>，問<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:pair:m0009" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>以<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:pair:m0011" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝安</persName>、<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:pair:m0014" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">王坦之</persName>所任，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:pair:m0020" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>曰：「渠等不為汝所處分。」</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:summer" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">秋，七月，己亥，南郡宣武公<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:summer:m0013" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>薨。初，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:summer:m0019" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>疾篤，諷朝廷求九錫，屢使人趣之。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:summer:m0036" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝安</persName>、<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:summer:m0039" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">王坦之</persName>故緩其事，使<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-103-jin098-huanwen-succession:summer:m0048" ref="yin_215_w6q">袁宏</persName>具草。</p>
</text>
